    "title": "Olive Garden Italian Kitchen",
    "description": "The Olive Garden app conveniently brings your favorites to your fingertips. Browse the menu, place and save To Go orders, save your spot on the waitlist and more, all within a few taps.\r\n\r\nFind Your Olive Garden:\r\n-Easily find your closest restaurant\r\n-Check to see what hours we are open\r\n-Save your favorite location\r\n\r\nJoin The Waitlist:\r\n-Check the current wait times for your Olive Garden\r\n-Quickly add your name to the waitlist\r\n-When you arrive, check in with the host\r\n-Your table may not be ready immediately upon arrival, but your spot on the waitlist will get you seated sooner\r\n\r\nQuick Order & Reorder:\r\n-Easily order your favorites To Go\r\n-Save your order on the app for later\r\n-Reorder your favorites with just a few taps\r\n\r\nPayments & Gift Cards:\r\n-Order faster and save your preferred payment\r\n-Use, save and reload gift cards to your profile\r\n\r\nWith the Olive Garden App, we're all family here! (TM) \r\nLegal:\r\nMust be 13+. Prices and participation may vary. View our online privacy notice at http://www.olivegarden.com/privacy-policy. \r\n\u00a9 Darden Concepts, Inc. All rights reserved.",
